/-!
# The case `%mean` of `+run`: `+mean-konst` and the branch `YES` (README Gaps 25)

`crKmean` (door axis `144095121988648958`, 577 cells) is `[8 cmKonst [6
cmTest cmYes cmNo]]` (nouns by `tools/gen/runhintm.py`, `cm_eq`):
`=/  konst  (mean-konst b.nomm k.nomm)`, then `?:  &(mono ?=(~ konst))`,
`YES` (15 cells) the recursion `$(nomm [%11 [%mean p.nomm] q.nomm
body.nomm])`, `NO` (529 cells) the constant (`mono` `&`) or the soft
calls (`mono` `|`), `CompRunHintMeanNo.lean`.

* `+mean-konst` (door axis `252`, 47 cells) is the gate `[8 [1 BUNT] [1
  mkBat] 0 1]`: `?~  k  ~`, then `?.  pure:(~(got by code.long-ska) b)  ~
  k`.  **`comp_mean_konst`**: it returns `meanKonst env b k` when the code
  entry of `b` has `pure` `env.pure b` (`CodePure`, needed only when `k`
  is `some`).
* `cr_disp_mean`: `crDol` on `[%mean ..]` is `crKmean`.
* `runLCH_mean_none`: with no constant the model at `mono` `&` is that of
  `n11d %mean p q body`.
* **`comp_run_mean_yes`**: with no constant, the case on every goal from
  the link of `n11d %mean p q body` at the same goal; **`partH_mean_yes`**:
  a `PartH` from those of `p` and `q` (through `partH_n11d_kept`).
-/

